{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはよう☀"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、りさとご飯に行きました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNFJ93BCR5DPH1VJYV47QE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">飯テロだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りさは年下って感じがしないです。\nむしろ私より大人って感じです!\n落ち着いてるからかな?\nでも、ご飯を食べにいったらまだ知らなかった話とかも沢山できたのでよかったです^ - ^\n意外な共通点があったり、、 \nまた行こう〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パノラマって機能、すごい。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNFK8K5TREQ24RHNCM6SR8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n長い!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近々、カメラを買う予定なのでとても楽しみです📷"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その場でチェキにできる機能がついてるカメラもいいな。\nねる作チェキと。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNFM8D33Q3AGAH6FZ0J22V","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい思い出だな〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホトケでも、またどっか行こうね。\nザンビ頑張れ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。\n⊿長沢菜々香"}],"source":"archive"}